    "detailed_description": "You've been trapped in a cursed elevator that inevitably brings you to the 0th floor. To escape, follow the instructions posted on the notice.<br><br>According to the notice, you must:<br><br><br><strong>- Immediately close the door if you find anything unusual on the floor you arrive at.<br><br>- If there's nothing on the floor, wait for the door to close.<br><br>- Do not make any rash moves if the floor you arrive at is filled with red light.<br><br>- Close the door immediately if you're about to be attacked on the floor.<br><br>- Move between floors in the order listed on the notice.<br><br><br>Follow the instructions to escape.</strong><br><br><br><br>\u203bThis game is inspired by &quot;The Exit 8&quot;.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Volume</h2>There are 7 types of stages in total.<br>There are 4 types of floors for each of the 7 levels, making a total of 28 types.<br>There are 112 types of anomalies in total.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play time</h2>Single play: 10 to 60 minutes<br>Complete clear: 90 to 420 minutes<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Distribution Guidelines</h2>- Regardless of whether you are an individual or a corporation, you can stream without a license.<br>- Monetization is only allowed using the features provided by the video streaming sites.<br>- It would be appreciated if you could include the game's name in the video or stream title and link to the Steam page in the description or similar sections.<br><br><br>Furthermore, we bear no responsibility for any damages resulting from streaming videos of this game.<br>\u203bThe contents of this guideline are subject to change without notice.",
